# Only real build output is excluded here.
#
# src/config/*.json is generated rather than authored, but it is a genuine
# build input: the app cannot resolve a single address without it, and the
# files it is generated from (devnet.json at the repo root, and the IDL under
# target/) live outside this directory, so they are never uploaded when app/ is
# the deploy root. Those copies are committed now, so both a CLI upload and a
# Git integration build have them. This file still matters for the CLI, which
# would otherwise fall back to .gitignore.
node_modules
.next
out
